#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:1
msgid "D20 接口与接线"
msgstr "D20 Connector and Wiring"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:3
msgid "适用范围"
msgstr "Scope"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:6
msgid ""
"本页适用于 **HM-D20-4G** 和 **HM-D20-LoRa** 移动站，说明外部接口、8-pin 引脚"
"和首次接线要求。接线只按**连接器视角与 Pin 1–8 顺序**核对，不按导线颜色判断。"
msgstr ""
"This page applies to **HM-D20-4G** and **HM-D20-LoRa** rovers, explaining "
"the external interfaces, 8-pin pins, and initial wiring requirements. Wiring "
"should be checked only according to the **connector view and Pin 1–8 "
"order**, not by wire color."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:9
msgid "接口总览"
msgstr "Connector overview"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:12
msgid ""
"上电前必须逐线核对 8-pin 定义 接错线可能造成设备永久性损坏。必须在**断电状态"
"**下按连接器视角和 Pin 1–8 顺序逐线核对：Pin 6（5 V）只连接 5 V ±0.5 V 电源正"
"极，Pin 1（GND）连接电源负极；禁止正负极反接，禁止使用超出 4.5–5.5 V 范围的电"
"源，禁止把电源正极接到 TX、RX、PPS 或其他信号线。"
msgstr ""
"Verify every 8-pin connection before power-on. Incorrect wiring may "
"permanently damage the device. With power **off**, check Pins 1–8 from the "
"connector view. Connect Pin 6 (5 V) only to the positive lead of a 5 V ±0.5 "
"V supply and Pin 1 (GND) to its negative lead. Do not reverse polarity, use "
"a supply outside 4.5–5.5 V, or connect the positive supply lead to TX, RX, "
"PPS, or any other signal pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:15
msgid ""
"交付线束可能采用不同的导线颜色排列，颜色不代表信号定义。不要只凭颜色、插头方"
"向或其他设备的线序接线；若无法确认连接器视角、Pin 顺序或标签，请勿上电，并联"
"系技术支持确认。"
msgstr ""
"The delivered wiring harness may use different wire color arrangements, and "
"the colors do not represent signal definitions. Do not wire connections "
"based solely on color, plug orientation, or the wire sequence of other "
"devices; if you cannot confirm the connector view, pin order, or labels, do "
"not power on and contact technical support for confirmation."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:17
msgid "![D20 接口定义](../images/d20-interface.png)"
msgstr "![D20 Interface Definition](../images/d20-interface.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:17
msgid "D20 接口定义"
msgstr "D20 Interface Definition"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:19
msgid ""
"图中的彩色引导线仅用于区分相邻 Pin，不代表交付线束的导线颜色；接线定义始终以"
"连接器视角和 Pin 1–8 顺序为准。"
msgstr ""
"The colored guide lines in the diagram are only used to distinguish adjacent "
"pins and do not represent the wire colors of the delivered harness; the "
"wiring definition is always based on the connector's perspective and the Pin "
"1–8 sequence."

