#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:29
msgid ""
"以下 Pin 顺序按上图所示设备底部视角、连接器从上到下排列。设备提供两个电气连通"
"的 GND 引脚；靠近 PPS 的 Pin 7 GND 是 PPS 配套地，同时与 Pin 1 GND 连通。"
msgstr ""
"The following pin sequence is arranged according to the bottom view of the "
"device shown in the above figure, with the connectors listed from top to "
"bottom. The device provides two electrically connected GND pins; the GND at "
"Pin 7 near PPS is the ground for PPS and is also connected to Pin 1 GND."

