#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:42
msgid "串口与供电边界"
msgstr "Serial and power requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:44
msgid "必须同时满足"
msgstr "Must be met simultaneously"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:47
msgid "**设备供电**：5 V ±0.5 V（4.5–5.5 V）。"
msgstr "**Device Power Supply**: 5 V ±0.5 V (4.5–5.5 V)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:48
msgid "**UART I/O 电平**：3.3 V。"
msgstr "**UART IO level**: 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:49
msgid "**PPS I/O 电平**：3.3 V。"
msgstr "**PPS I/O level**: 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:50
msgid "**默认串口**：115200 bps、8 数据位、1 停止位、无校验、无流控。"
msgstr ""
"**Default serial port**: 115200 bps, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, no parity, no "
"flow control."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:51
msgid ""
"**接口限制**：禁止向 UART 或 PPS 接入 5 V 信号，禁止直接连接 RS232 接口。"
msgstr ""
"**Interface restrictions**: Do not apply 5 V to UART or PPS, and do not "
"connect RS232 directly."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:55
msgid "**5 V 供电不等于 5 V 串口电平。**"
msgstr "**5 V power is not 5 V UART logic.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:57
msgid ""
"Pin 6 的 **5 V** 仅用于设备供电；Pin 4（TX）、Pin 5（RX）和 Pin 8（PPS）的 I/"
"O 电平均为 **3.3 V**。禁止使用 5 V UART 转接器或把任何 5 V 信号接入 TX、RX、"
"PPS，否则可能造成设备永久性损坏。请使用标配 USB 转 UART 转接器，或在接线前确"
"认飞控、主控的 UART/PPS 电平兼容 3.3 V。"
msgstr ""
"Pin 6 (**5 V**) is for device power only. Pin 4 (TX), Pin 5 (RX), and Pin 8 "
"(PPS) all use **3.3 V** I/O. Do not use a 5 V UART adapter or apply any 5 V "
"signal to TX, RX, or PPS; doing so may permanently damage the device. Use "
"the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, or verify that the flight-controller or "
"host UART/PPS interface supports 3.3 V logic before wiring."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:60
msgid "首次接线"
msgstr "Initial wiring"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:62
msgid "保持设备断电，用万用表确认电源为 5 V ±0.5 V，并确认正负极。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the device powered off, use a multimeter to confirm that the power "
"supply is 5 V ±0.5 V, and check the polarity."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:63
msgid ""
"对照上图和 8-pin 表，按连接器视角与 Pin 1–8 顺序逐线核对；Pin 6（5 V）接电源"
"正极，Pin 1（GND）接电源负极。"
msgstr ""
"Compare the above diagram with the 8-pin table, and check each line in order "
"from Pin 1 to Pin 8 from the connector's perspective; Pin 6 (5 V) is "
"connected to the positive terminal of the power supply, and Pin 1 (GND) is "
"connected to the negative terminal of the power supply."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:64
msgid "D20 TX 接外部设备 RX，D20 RX 接外部设备 TX。"
msgstr ""
"D20 TX connects to the external device RX, and D20 RX connects to the "
"external device TX."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:65
msgid ""
"D20 与标配 USB 转 UART 转接器、飞控或主控共地，并确认对方 UART 为 3.3 V I/O "
"电平；使用 PPS 时，目标输入也须兼容 3.3 V。"
msgstr ""
"When using the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, a flight controller, or a host "
"controller, connect its ground to D20 ground and verify that its UART uses "
"3.3 V I/O. If PPS is used, its input must also support 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:66
msgid "仅使用定位时，SCL、SDA 和 PPS 可以不连接。"
msgstr ""
"When using positioning only, SCL, SDA, and PPS do not need to be connected."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:67
msgid "再次确认电源正极没有连接到 TX、RX、SCL、SDA 或 PPS，且正负极没有反接。"
msgstr ""
"Double-check that the positive power supply is not connected to TX, RX, SCL, "
"SDA, or PPS, and that the positive and negative terminals are not reversed."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:68
msgid "4G 或 LoRa 天线安装牢靠后再上电。"
msgstr "Power on only after the 4G or LoRa antenna is securely installed."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:70
msgid "飞控 6-pin 转接线"
msgstr "Flight controller 6-pin adapter cable"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:72
msgid ""
"接入带有标注标准 6-pin GPS/UART 接口的飞控时，可以使用配套的 D20 8-pin 转飞"
"控 6-pin 转接线。连接前仍须核对 D20 8-pin 定义、转接线两端 Pin 顺序和飞控接口"
"定义，确认 5 V 供电、3.3 V UART/PPS、TX/RX 和 GND 一一对应；接口外形相同不能"
"替代线序核对。"
msgstr ""
"For a flight controller with a labeled standard 6-pin GPS/UART port, use the "
"supplied D20 8-pin-to-6-pin adapter cable. Before connecting, verify the D20 "
"pinout, both cable-end pin orders, and the flight-controller pinout. Confirm "
"the 5 V supply, 3.3 V UART/PPS, TX/RX, and GND mapping; matching connector "
"shapes do not guarantee a matching pinout."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:74
msgid "上电后按[上位机连接与串口调试](host-tool.md)检查输出。"
msgstr ""
"After powering on, press [Host Connection and Serial Debugging](host-tool."
"md) to check the output."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:76
msgid "接线完成判据"
msgstr "Wiring success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:79
msgid "上电后设备持续输出定位数据，供电稳定，线缆和连接器无异常发热或松动。"
msgstr ""
"After powering on, the device continuously outputs positioning data, the "
"power supply is stable, and the cables and connectors show no abnormal "
"heating or looseness."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:82
msgid "磁力计"
msgstr "Magnetometer"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md:84
msgid ""
"D20 标配 QMC5883L 磁力计，通过 SCL/SDA 连接主控。磁力计需要按目标系统的标准流"
"程校准；安装时应尽量远离电机、电源线、大电流设备和磁性材料。"
msgstr ""
"The D20 is equipped with a standard QMC5883L magnetometer, connected to the "
"main controller via SCL/SDA. The magnetometer needs to be calibrated "
"according to the standard procedure of the target system; during "
"installation, it should be kept as far away as possible from motors, power "
"lines, high-current devices, and magnetic materials."

